{"body":{"text":["**recreating field:** what glass is, as an operating system is what Unix is: one field that everything acts through, whose purpose is creating anew from what it holds, what is created becoming more of what it holds, nothing lost."]},"id":"1M89J1SGDVQA01M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**holonic field:** the level beneath, as a file system is beneath Unix: a field whose every part is a holon."]},"id":"1M89J1SGDVQA01N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**re-member:** what a reference that holds does: it keeps a part a member of every whole it stands in, never a copy."]},"id":"1M89J1SGDVQA01P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**statement:** a commit as its maker's act: what was chosen, kept with what had been read; apart from the elevation's statement."]},"id":"1M89J1SGDVQA01Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
