{"body":{"text":["Glass stays one store, its things namespaced within it as wholes, so each may later be loaded and depended on alone: \"It actually has its own structure, so maybe that's fine because we're namespacing inside the store anyway\" (18/105). The store holding Knowledge is wiki: \"Maybe we want to call it wiki\" (18/105). Measures and statistics stand with what they relate to: \"they should probably be stored with where they are\" (18/105); the cut put the measures with the author, since every one points at a session; measures are to go with the elevation (23/110, 23/111). *Leaning, 18/105.* The components were the first so taken away, at the author's word that they are not glass's: \"Definitely not, again the values of something being whole in and of itself\" (22/37, 22/43), the leaning so narrowed."]},"id":"1M89J1SGDVQA01S","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The author's words are quoted as he wrote or spoke them, cited by session and utterance, so 15/15 is the fifteenth session's fifteenth. A claim that is not plain fact closes with a mark: **Settled**, by the author, on the day or at the utterance given; **Leaning**, his, with his doubt quoted; **Proposed**, a session's, unratified and free to change; **Open**, a question standing. The elevation's statuses are these marks, with closed beside them."]},"id":"1M89J1SGDVQA01T","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}